# Build output: regenerated on every publish. Never committed — a stale feed in the repo is a
# rollback waiting to be served. (This is also why the publish workflow passes --sequence from
# run_number: with no previous dist/ to count from, the builder cannot derive one.)


# The app's built-in skills are ALSO not committed — but that rule lives in plugins/zeraix/.gitignore,
# which the exporter regenerates with one entry per generated skill. It is deliberately not a
# wildcard over the namespace: hand-authored official plugins (zeraix/office-suite) live beside the
# generated ones and must be committed, and a namespace-wide ignore silently swallowed them.
